From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:40:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 007/159] [ae-patch] Name the slots row Dashboard and show the
 slots in the session header

The sidebar's Slots n/3 row becomes Dashboard n/3, the one nav entry for
omnigent-ae's Dashboard extension, active on its routes. A new chip in the
session header shows the session's ae.status and the slot count and opens the
Dashboard, so the count is visible on every session, the phone included.
Upstream edit: two lines in web/src/shell/ChatHeader.tsx.
